IMAGES
------
The images on the project page (website/public/gallery/) are development images
generated by the authors with Google Gemini and are shared under CC BY 4.0. No
ConstructionSite10k or MOCS image is included. The other development images are
not distributed in this repository and remain subject to the terms of their
sources.

THIRD-PARTY MODELS
------------------
The code calls models and tools (served through Ollama, GroundingDINO, DETR via
Hugging Face Transformers, OpenCLIP) that are not included and remain subject to
their own licenses.
